<title>FRANCE: Two ships loading wheat in Rouen, seven more due.</title>
<headline>Two ships loading wheat in Rouen, seven more due.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two ships are loading a total of 35,000 tonnes of wheat at Rouen, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The wheat is for export to Italy and Tunisia, they said.</p>
<p>Seven more ships are expected in port by April 25 to load around 143,000 tonnes of wheat. The destination was not specified.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
